  step,dige:8f35858fd314869e
  step=2,dige:bd158c2fffcde056,desc:seed four cogs — two oak kin split by the strangers pine and birch
  step=3,dige:24da78c12c842c32,desc:mint A:Vyto beside the run and commission it on the four cogs
    Assertion:board-stood,sentence:the glass was commissioned on four cogs and stood its board
  step=4,dige:611c9c9f1fb74096,desc:stir to rest — relate weaves the one kin edge and the attraction bunches the oaks
    Assertion:kin-edge-wove,sentence:the relate organ wove one kin edge — the two oaks share a genus and the strangers share nothing
    Assertion:four-distinct,sentence:the solve seated four distinct cells — the attraction drew the kin close but never collapsed them
  step=5,dige:6ccdf07738684323,desc:sever the kinship — retag one oak so the edge drops and the pair rests free
    Assertion:kin-bunched,sentence:the shared genus bunched the kin — the two oaks rest closer to each other while joined than once their kinship is severed
